Speaker 2: This, there's this particular food that you can't eat simply because XYZ and I.

00:00:41.959 --> 00:00:44.080
Speaker 1: Mean, you can't see by the riverside.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.760
Speaker 2: There's someone I encountered one of the.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.770
Speaker 2: She can't eat fish because from the.

