00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.470
Speaker 2: Now think about that.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:26.230
Speaker 2: Such a powerful figure for the understanding of Christian doctrine was in Africa.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:37.460
Speaker 2: So the idea that Christianity is a white man's religion was someone's ill conceived idea to just as a direct rebellion.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:38.300
Speaker 2: Exactly.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.220
Speaker 1: Yes, exactly.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.100
Speaker 2: Yes, exactly.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:46.620
