00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.580
Speaker 2: Let's take for example, there are chairs.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:11:01.630
Speaker 2: Was that what the Yoruba Kings in the 1300s used to sit on?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:02.950
Speaker 2: No, that evolved.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:03.950
Speaker 1: So why did it evolve?

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:05.150
