Speaker 1: No, I. I know that some of the Ankara we use comes from Indonesia and Asia.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:32.740
Speaker 1: I don't know about who started, but I know a bulk of what we use comes from Indonesia.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.260
