00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:34.700
Speaker 2: Yes.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:47.180
Speaker 2: Meaning you can bring in new positive features into what is already pre existing culture and update the culture and you still will not lose the very essence.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.100
