00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:49.860
Speaker 1: Beautiful.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:50.580
Speaker 1: So powerful.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.060
Speaker 1: I found that.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.540
Speaker 1: I find that absolutely powerful.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.300
Speaker 2: So powerful.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:12:02.460
Speaker 2: And to emphasize the last Thing when it comes to witnessing to African traditional religion, adherence is still the power of God.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:02.980
Speaker 1: The power of God.

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:03.780
Speaker 2: The power of God.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:04.900
Speaker 2: The power of God.

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:12.020
