00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.980
Speaker 2: I came with the demonstrations of the spirit and of power.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:25.280
Speaker 2: And it's so important because even when Christianity began to gain a strong foothold in this country now after the times of the white missionaries, when we start having indigenous preachers.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.760
Speaker 2: Yes, take the faith.

