00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:07.340
Speaker 2: Meaning a very crucial aspect of evangelism is what Jesus said.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.460
Speaker 2: These signs shall follow them that believe.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.990
Speaker 1: In my name, in my name.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.310
Speaker 1: This is something crucial.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:18.470
Speaker 1: You know, to engage people like this, you need the power of God.

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:32.030
Speaker 1: You know, my father was born into Islam and born into Islam, you know, there's a lot of syncretism in Islam and syncretism is just a high sounding term for mixing ideologies of religion.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.030
Speaker 1: So they were also having traditional worship.

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:38.670
Speaker 1: And suddenly his father, who was an imam, dies like a chicken.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.020
Speaker 1: And everybody begins to console the gods of how he died.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:51.340
Speaker 1: And then they realized that there was something in the spirit realm that sent an attack his way and was to send to kill everybody as well.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.340
Speaker 1: So everybody dispersed, looking for power.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:59.500
Speaker 1: And my father says what brought him into the faith first was the fact that he was actually looking.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:03.020
Speaker 1: What power is strong enough to break this hold of me?

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:16.820
Speaker 1: Till he encountered a man from a full gospel fellowship home who gives me a raw testimony about his life, saying that he went to a beach one time, praying with the people in full gospel and somebody slaps him.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:20.340
Speaker 1: And he looked around, didn't see anybody who slapped him.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:26.740
Speaker 1: So he just begins to speak in tongues and leaves only for him.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:33.200
Speaker 1: Five minutes later a person runs to him and we almost looking injured and scattered and he says it's all well.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.120
Speaker 1: He said, I'm the one that slapped you.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:44.520
Speaker 1: So we usually have meetings around here on the beach and you walked in and usually we keep it as a point for sacrifice to slap and sacrifice to our God.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.360
Speaker 1: But the moment I slapped you said you uttered strange sounds.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:50.720
Speaker 1: Fire went to the heavens, came down and scattered us.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.160
Speaker 1: And the man asked a simple question.

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.480
Speaker 1: I just want the power you have.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:58.000
Speaker 1: And the man told him, said the power is in the name of Jesus.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.640
Speaker 1: Believe the gospel and be saved.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:07.310
Speaker 1: And when my dad heard that testimony was like a power is possible that can save me from what my father died from.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:12.750
Speaker 1: This was a man who was tying things on his waist, who was loyal to the gods of his father.

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:17.710
Speaker 1: But a singular display of power brought him to show the reality of God.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:25.830
Speaker 1: That's why the Bible says that having spoiled principalities speaking about Jesus, he made an open show of them triumphant over.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:26.910
